400	  /// Boundaries: optimistic user bubble, then subscribes to
401	  /// `ChatRepository.sendMessage`'s own stream, appending tokens as they
402	  /// arrive and finalizing/failing the AI bubble on `done`/any `Left` —
403	  /// the bubble's own [ChatUiMessage.content] is never cleared on failure
404	  /// (I/O matrix), only its [ChatUiMessage.status] changes.
405	  ///
406	  /// A no-op while [state] isn't [ChatReady] (bootstrap still in flight
407	  /// or failed — the composer is disabled in that case anyway), while
408	  /// [content] is blank once trimmed, while [_isSending] is already
409	  /// true — this story never races two concurrent sends against the one
410	  /// in-memory session — or while [ChatReady.isOffline] (review finding:
